        "problem": "What is the cardinality of $M\\times M$ for $M={1,2,3…,10}?$",
        "worked_solution": "For any two finite sets $A$ and $B,$ the cardinality of $A\\times B$ is\n\n$$\n|A\\times B|=|A|\\cdot |B|.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|M\\times M| & =|M|\\cdot |M| \\\\  & =10\\cdot 10 \\\\  & =100.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
